{
  "appid": 289650,
  "name": "刺客信条：大革命",
  "type": "game",
  "short_description": "巴黎，1789 年。在这款动作冒险游戏中，以阿尔诺·多里安的视角，亲历法国大革命的风云。化身刺客，为拯救祖国，揭穿革命幕后黑手的面纱。",
  "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >无情的新世界，凶猛的新主角</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >扮演全新一代刺客阿尔诺，掌握比前辈们更加致命的手段。你的猎物将面对各种强劲武器，比如兼备十字弓功能的袖剑“幻刃”。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/289650/extras/4a1fae13143b814108062fa5bd618003.poster.avif?t=1773328332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/289650/extras/4a1fae13143b814108062fa5bd618003.webm?t=1773328332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/289650/extras/4a1fae13143b814108062fa5bd618003.mp4?t=1773328332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >体验无缝糅合跑酷、战斗、潜行的玩法</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过无缝跑酷、全新战斗系统以及改进的潜行玩法，随心所欲操控你的刺客角色。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/289650/extras/0fc50968572ac193611e66d23e8c39b3.poster.avif?t=1773328332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/289650/extras/0fc50968572ac193611e66d23e8c39b3.webm?t=1773328332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/289650/extras/0fc50968572ac193611e66d23e8c39b3.mp4?t=1773328332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >探索风云变幻的巴黎</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >原本优雅的魅力之都，燃起了恐怖混乱的革命之火。你将在这个全比例还原的开放世界中，亲眼见证令人惊叹的历史篇章。从攻占巴士底狱到处决路易十六国王，一桩桩关键事件将彻底改变巴黎街头的面貌，最终决定法国的命运。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/289650/extras/e9e06d81088adff9aa05e8837c768939.poster.avif?t=1773328332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/289650/extras/e9e06d81088adff9aa05e8837c768939.webm?t=1773328332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/289650/extras/e9e06d81088adff9aa05e8837c768939.mp4?t=1773328332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
